@startuml sequence-make-reservation
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Create reservation (UC4)

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

Customer -> FE: Browse cars and select a car
Customer -> FE: Click "Reserve"

opt customer not logged in
  FE --> Customer: Show log in / create account form
  Customer -> FE: Log in, or create an account (UC2 / UC1)
end

FE --> Customer: Open the booking form
Customer -> FE: Enter pickup and return date & time
FE -> FE: Check that return is after pickup and both\nare within opening hours (Mon-Fri, 08:00-20:00)

alt date/time invalid
  FE -> FE: Show date/time error
else dates valid
  FE -> API: GET /cars/{id}/availability\n?start_date=...&end_date=...
  API -> DB: Check availability (UC4a) —\nany overlapping CONFIRMED reservation?
  DB --> API: reservation / none
  API --> FE: 200 OK {available: true / false}

  alt car not available
    FE -> FE: Show "car already booked\nfor this time", disable submitting
  else car available
    FE --> Customer: "Termín je dostupný" + price estimate
    Customer -> FE: Choose payment method (Cash / Card)
    opt Card
      Customer -> FE: Fill mock card details\n(never sent to the server)
    end
    Customer -> FE: Submit reservation
    FE -> API: POST /reservations/ (JWT)\n{car_id, start_date, end_date, payment_method}
    API -> API: Re-validate opening hours (N12) —\ndefense in depth, in case this request\ndidn't go through the frontend's own check

    alt outside opening hours
      API --> FE: 422 Unprocessable Entity\n"Vyzvednutí i vrácení auta jsou možné jen\nv pracovní dny (Po–Pá) mezi 8:00 a 20:00"
    else within opening hours
      API -> DB: Load the car
      DB --> API: car
      API -> DB: Check availability again (UC4a) —\nthe slot may have been confirmed in the meantime
      DB --> API: reservation / none

      alt slot already taken
        API --> FE: 409 Conflict\n"Auto je v požadovaném termínu již\npotvrzenou rezervací obsazeno"
      else still available
        API -> API: Calculate total price\n(daily rate per full 24h block + hourly\nrate for the rest, capped at one more day)
        API -> DB: INSERT Reservation\n(status DRAFT, payment_method, total_price)
        DB --> API: reservation
        API --> FE: 201 Created {reservation}
      end
    end
  end
end

FE --> Customer: See result\n(reservation awaiting admin approval,\nor error message)
@enduml
